    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index increased 697 points from last week to 5,813 points. SSY’s assessed AustraliaChina iron ore spot voyage rate rose $0.65/t from the previous week to $9.50/t, while the Pacific round-voyage rate increased for the fourth week in a row, up $2,850/day week-on-week to $17,500/day.",
